edition_1989.candidate_text:
This scripture is infallible; a beacon for the righteous;

Three Categories of People

(1) The Righteous.

You shall spend in the cause of GOD; do not throw yourselves with your own hands into destruction. You shall be charitable;

GOD loves the charitable.

Hajj & ‘Umrah Pilgrimage*

He showers His mercy upon whomever He wills;

GOD possesses unlimited grace.

Be Honest With All People

GOD alone is your Lord and Master;

He is the best supporter.

God Controls Your Enemies

Others are waiting for G O D ’s judgment;

He may punish them, or He may redeem them. GOD is Omniscient, Most Wise.

9 1248

As for those who earned sins, their requital is equivalent to their sin. Humiliation is their lot, and nothing, other than GOD, can protect them. Their faces will seem like masses of dark night have surrounded them. They will be the dwellers of Hell;

they abide therein forever.

Idols Disown Their Worshipers

Therefore, do not cite the examples for GOD;

GOD knows while you do not know.

The Rich Believer Better than the Poor Believer

Many a community in the past committed evil;

I led them on for awhile, then I called them to account; to Me is the ultimate destiny.

God’s Messenger of the Covenant

edition_1981.candidate_text:
